    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.sessions\n\n### Description\n\n`mini.sessions` does not appear to automatically create the default `sessions` folder if it's not present. This will be a cool addition to automate for fresh installs as it reduces one manual step. Thanks for all your super clean plugins!",
